      "cat-harness:section": "than treating its absence (exit 127) as a broken toolchain.",
      "prov:value": "**B.2** — Change the build invocation so the background hook's stdout no longer\npipes elan/lake backtraces into the transcript (the timing report still reads\nthe log file, so nothing is lost):"
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/folio-assistant-migration.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "§7 Cross-repo coordination",
      "prov:value": "On landing the §5 items: update qou's `bean-coordination` ownership note and close\nthe tracking beans (`j8el`, `bmwh`, `17ht`, `kpzd`, `d9nu`). Do **not** delete\nqou's remaining `todos/` files until the §5.4 / qou readers are repointed\n(`/api/todos` route + the 3 goal queues and their `coordinate.md` / `STATUS.md`\nlinks; leave the QA sidecar as bulk JSON).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 17ht",
        "bean bmwh",
        "bean d9nu",
        "bean j8el",
        "bean kpzd"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/folio-assistant-migration.md#provenance-14",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "§8 Cross-agent session-start design (resolves Q2)",
      "prov:value": "**Findings (2026-06, confidence high for Claude/Gemini, medium for Antigravity):**\n- All three expose a `SessionStart` **command hook** that runs a shell script and\n  injects its stdout into model context (Claude: stdout→context; Gemini:\n  `hookSpecificOutput.additionalContext`; Antigravity: session-start lifecycle\n  hook). Gemini CLI and Antigravity share essentially the same JSON hook format.\n- All three read **`AGENTS.md` natively** — now a Linux Foundation standard\n  (Agentic AI Foundation), also read by Cursor, Copilot, Codex, Aider, etc.\n- All three support **MCP servers**.\n- `.claude/skills/hooks/session-start.sh` is **not** a native Claude Code trigger;\n  Claude only auto-runs `SessionStart` hooks declared in `.claude/settings.json`.\n  (Today that script runs only if folio-assistant's own framework invokes it.)",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/folio-assistant-migration.md#provenance-15",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "§8 Cross-agent session-start design (resolves Q2)",
      "prov:value": "**Design — three layers, no live logic duplicated:**\n1. **Discipline (universal, static): `AGENTS.md`** at repo root — read natively by\n   every agent. Carries the beans-for-todos rules. Tool files are thin stubs\n   (`CLAUDE.md` → `@AGENTS.md`; `GEMINI.md` → \"See AGENTS.md\"). *(landed)*\n2. **Live state (per-CLI hook over one shared script):** generalize\n   `session-start-coord-sweep.sh` into the single primer (emits `beans prime` +\n   CLI-independent bean list + main-delta as markdown to stdout). Wire it from each\n   CLI's `SessionStart` command hook — the hook config differs per tool\n   (`.claude/settings.json` vs Gemini/Antigravity `hooks.json`) but invokes the\n   **same** script.\n3. **Live state (platform): expose `beans prime` as an MCP resource/tool** from\n   folio-assistant's MCP. Any MCP-connected agent of any flavor then gets identical\n   live priming — the cleanest cross-tool path, and the fallback for CLIs without a\n   usable session hook."
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/folio-assistant-migration.md#provenance-16",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "§8 Cross-agent session-start design (resolves Q2)",
      "prov:value": "**Status:** Layer 1 landed (`AGENTS.md` + `CLAUDE.md` stub). Layer 2 landed for\nClaude (`.claude/settings.json` SessionStart → generalized shared primer); the\nGemini/Antigravity hook configs reuse the same script and remain to be added.\nLayer 3 landed: `work_plan_prime` MCP tool (`src/tools/beans-prime.ts`, wired in\n`src/server.ts`) exposes `beans prime` + `beans list` (with a `beans/` fallback)\nto any MCP-connected agent. Sources: agents.md\n(openai/agents.md, Linux Foundation AAIF); Claude Code\nhooks/memory docs; Gemini CLI hooks reference + GEMINI.md docs; Antigravity SDK /\nMCP guides."
    }
  ]
